{title: Chhoo Lene Do Nazuk Hoton Ko}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [G] [Am],        Chhoo lene do nazuk hothon ko
[Am] [G],        kuch aur nahi hai jaam hai ye
[Am] [G] [Am],        Kudrat ne jo hum ko bakhsha hai
[Am] [G],        wo sab se haseen inaam hai ye
[Am] [G] [Am],        Choo lene do nazuk honton ko
[Am] [G],        Sharma ke na yuuhi kho dena
[Em] [Am],        rangeen jawani ki ghariyan
[Am] [G],        Betaab dharakte seenoo ka
[Am] [G],        armaan bhara paigaam hai ye
[Am] [G],        Achhon ko bura saabit karna
[Em] [Am],        duniya ki purani aadat hai
[C] [G] [Am],        Iss may ko mubarak cheez samajh
[Am] [G],        maana ke bahut badnaam hai ye
